## Public listing search (`mh-events-search`)

Public pages share the organic search band (`.mh-events-search`). New or existing **Search by Name/Title** fields on those pages must use the shared combobox, not a raw input.

```tsx
// ✅ DO: public combobox — draft while typing, commit on select / Enter / Search
<PublicListSearchCombobox<EventSponsorsDTO & Record<string, unknown>>
  items={sponsors as (EventSponsorsDTO & Record<string, unknown>)[]}
  committedValue={searchTerm}
  onCommit={commitSearch}
  onInputChange={setSearchDraft}
  inputId="sponsorSearch"
  placeholder="Enter sponsor name…"
  searchRemote={(query) =>
    fetchPublicTypeahead<EventSponsorsDTO>({
      resource: 'event-sponsors',
      query,
      containsFields: ['name', 'companyName'],
      extraParams: { 'isActive.equals': 'true', sort: 'priorityRanking,asc' },
    })
  }
  getSearchFields={(s) => [s.name, s.companyName, s.type, s.tagline, s.id]}
  getCommitValue={(s) => s.name || ''}
  formatPrimary={(s) => s.name || 'Unnamed sponsor'}
  formatSecondary={(s) => [s.companyName, s.type].filter(Boolean).join(' · ')}
/>
```

- **Reuse, do not fork.** `PublicListSearchCombobox` only sets `mh-typeahead` / `mh-typeahead-input` classes. Behavior stays in `AdminListSearchCombobox` (debounce 280ms, cap 20, merge local+remote, ARIA combobox).
- **`committedValue` vs `onInputChange`.** Listing fetch depends on the committed string. `onInputChange` keeps the Search button in sync with typed text without refetching.
- **Remote search on public pages.** Use [`fetchPublicTypeahead`](mdc:src/lib/publicTypeaheadSearch.ts) → relative `/api/proxy/{resource}` via `proxyApiPath`. Do **not** add `tenantId.equals` (the proxy injects it). Do **not** call `getAppUrl()` from the browser. Parallel `.contains` fields + numeric `id.equals`, then merge/dedupe.
- **Keep Search / Clear / date range.** Typeahead replaces only the text field. Date inputs and the Search/Clear buttons stay. Search commits the current draft; Clear commits `''`.
- **Dropdown CSS** lives under `body.modernist-home .mh-events-search` in [`modernist-homepage.css`](mdc:src/styles/modernist-homepage.css) (`overflow: visible`, listbox surface, hover). Do not restyle the admin combobox defaults for public pages — wrap with `PublicListSearchCombobox`.
- **Focus groups** already load the full set client-side — local `AdminListSearchCombobox` is enough (no `searchRemote` required).

| Public page | Combobox | Remote resource / fields |
|-------------|----------|--------------------------|
| [`/sponsors`](mdc:src/app/sponsors/page.tsx) | `PublicListSearchCombobox` | `event-sponsors` — `name`, `companyName`, id |
| [`/events`](mdc:src/app/events/page.tsx) | `PublicListSearchCombobox` | `event-details` — `title`, `caption`, id |
| [`/gallery`](mdc:src/app/gallery/components/GallerySearch.tsx) | `PublicListSearchCombobox` | albums via `searchAlbumsForGalleryTypeahead`; events via `searchEventsForGallery` |
| [`/polls`](mdc:src/components/polls/PollList.tsx) | `PublicListSearchCombobox` | `event-polls` — `title`, `description`, id |
| [`/focus-groups`](mdc:src/app/focus-groups/FocusGroupsGridWithSearch.tsx) | `AdminListSearchCombobox` | local name/slug/description/id |

